From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hjviewer <haejin.cho@yonsei.ac.kr>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 20:01:01 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 052/160] hjviewer: ui: desktop-settings: grouped cards, a pill
 sidebar, even rows

Settings kept upstream's grey cards with a shadow and a 20 px title inside, a sidebar
with a blue bar, filled blue buttons everywhere and rows 32 or 36 px apart. Now:

- Sidebar: the title bold in the text colour; each tab a rounded pill, primarySoft with
  the icon and label in primary when selected, the hover colour under the pointer.
  Upstream's _listItem stays, unused.
- _Card: the section title small above the card (13/600, textTertiary), the card from
  hjvCardDecoration, 24 px page margins and room below the last card; checkboxes and
  radios 36 px high in every card; a dropdown's menu on the card's colour with its
  current item tinted. Network's tiles sit inset so their hover is even, with quiet
  icons and a chevron on the rows that open a dialog.
- Buttons 36 px: _Button, _SubButton and the other secondary actions are the theme's
  outlined button; Login and Apply stay filled; the unlock button is a full-width
  filled button in the cards' margins instead of a grey card.
- Rows on the 4/8 grid: dropdowns, sub-fields and the recording folder; sub-options
  start under the parent's label; sub-labels in textSecondary and allowed to wrap.
- Account: the logged-in user as the card's first row (the avatar or a tinted person),
  then the logout button. About: thin lines around the update and the notice, links in
  primary, the copyright on primarySoft instead of a block of blue.
- Palette colours for the whitelist warning, the printer and Wayland errors and, in
  setting_widgets.dart, the server dialog's icons; slider values 14 px, tabular digits.

After an independent review (screens in light and dark, the diff, the code rules):

- Sidebar: the hover in hoverStrong, which shows on the canvas (hover did not).
- _Card: no canvasColor or focusColor of its own any more. The combo box's menu takes its
  colour from ComboBox, and keyboard focus in a card shows in the theme's focus colour
  again instead of primarySoft on the card.
- About: no rule above the update block, which has its own border; the links without a
  grey hover box flush with their text. The recording folder reads as a link, like About's.
- Network: a locked row's icon and chevron in the disabled colour.
- The relay delay, port and timeout fields at 14 px with tabular digits, as their labels.
- Socks5/Http(s) proxy on the desktop: the labels above the fields (hjvFieldLabel), as in
  the other dialogs; the help icon and the password's eye in the tertiary colour.
- Custom image quality (setting_widgets.dart): More shares the label's two shares and goes
  below the label as a whole when they do not fit, instead of both breaking between
  syllables in a narrow window; the quality and FPS rows stay aligned.
- Printer: the tips and the install button at the content margin; the unused
  _kCardLeftMargin goes.
- Wayland: the danger buttons on dangerFill.

_Card, _Button, _SubButton, _SubLabeledWidget and _lock stay restyled in place
rather than as _hjv builders beside upstream's: they have many call sites (26 for _Card),
and upstream's bodies would only remain as dead code.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
